                                                                                                    
           ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮           
           │                                                                            │           
           │  󰋼 Keyboard shortcuts                                                      │           
           │  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  │           
           │    ── Global ────────────────────────────────                              │           
           │    ❮j / ↓❯         Move down                                               │           
           │    ❮k / ↑❯         Move up                                                 │           
           │    ❮g / G❯         Top / Bottom                                            │           
           │    ❮c❯             Jump to playing track                                   │           
           │    ❮PgUp / PgDn❯   Page up / down                                          │           
           │    ❮v❯             Cycle view  Tracks / Albums / Artists                   │           
           │    ❮Enter❯         Play  (2nd Enter → Fullscreen)                          │           
           │    ❮Space❯         Pause / Resume                                          │           
           │    ❮n / p❯         Next / Previous                                         │           
           │    ❮< / >❯         Seek −5s / +5s                                          │           
           │    ❮[ / ]❯         Lyrics earlier / later  (0.5s)                          │           
           │    ❮+ / -❯         Volume up / down                                        │           
           │    ❮m❯             Cycle play mode                                         │           
           │    ❮e / z❯         Play next / add to queue                                │           
           │    ❮Q❯             Open play queue                                         │           
           │    ❮r / R❯         Lo-fi effect  lower / raise sample rate                 │           
           │    ❮b❯             Toggle 8-bit chip mode  (converts + crossfades)         │           
           │    ❮f❯             Toggle fullscreen                                       │           
           │    ❮l❯             Toggle lyrics / player panel                            │           
           │                                                                            │           
           │    Esc to close  ·  ↑↓ to scroll  ↓                                        │           
           │                                                                            │           
           ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯           
                                                                                                    